  =goth_choice_three
  For the first month of work, I was in love with all of it. The dedication and drama was everything I could hope for and more.  For the second month of work, I was positive the aesthetic was going to be the death of me. The monotony of endless black, day after day after day, slowly wore away at my senses and deadened my mind. By the end of the month, the environment was enough to make me scream. And before the third month of work was over, scream I did. 
  ->END